abstract: "Open Science companion package for a descriptive systematic mapping of media analytics and decision support in Russian, international English-language, and Chinese publication corpora. Contains the final tools registry (50 systems: 13 Russian, 30 international, 7 Chinese), PRISMA protocol, codebook, inter-coder reliability data, and reproducibility materials."
